vFM Player - Furnace examples

SD folder: /vFM/tests/furnace

Optional FUR/DMF test songs may be placed here. This folder may contain only documentation in the base package. Normal Furnace songs can be stored in your music folders.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/tests/furnace

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
